        industrial/construction area). Broader one-level: activity specificity lost, well-understood.
        Athena-local crosswalk confirms the W58 base maps to SNOMED CT 4077127, and 40417656 is the
        crocodile-specific descendant with the matching place qualifier.
        """
}
